From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:33:30 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] perf: Firedancer pre-cs_main parallel transaction hash,
 CheckRegularTransaction, and sighash precomputation

Warm transaction GetId()/GetHash(), run context-free CheckRegularTransaction,
and precompute PrecomputedTransactionData sighashes in parallel across
worker threads before acquiring cs_main.

